  "solution": "Giải phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>t</mi><mn>138</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>138</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy sau <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>138</mn></semantics></math> ngày thì khối lượng polonium-210 còn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
